        "content": "<p>Route on the first image was valid (except maybe for a weird hook into courtyard)<br>\nMovement from one part of Dzerbenes to another is allowed, no sign prohibits this, and it happens irl. One can follow this track: <a href=\"https://www.mapillary.com/app/?pKey=2261247298003401\">https://www.mapillary.com/app/?pKey=2261247298003401</a><br>\nLeft a comment under jhaluska's cs too.</p>\n<div class=\"message_embed\"><a class=\"message_embed_image\" href=\"https://www.mapillary.com/app/?pKey=2261247298003401\" style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://uploads.zulipusercontent.&quot;)\"></a><div class=\"data-container\"><div class=\"message_embed_title\"><a href=\"https://www.mapillary.com/app/?pKey=2261247298003401\" title=\"Mapillary\">Mapillary</a></div><div class=\"message_embed_description\">Street-level imagery, powered by collaboration and computer vision.</div></div></div>",
